WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:06,650
It’s cool not to rely on it anymore

2
00:00:06,890 --> 00:00:08,730
Xiaolu, don't panic. I'll try my strength.

3
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:29,590
My strength has almost doubled

4
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,300
About three hundred pounds

5
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,320
But I still can’t lift this thing

6
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:55,580
From now on, you will call me Xiaolu, Huzi.

7
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:57,100
Why did you find a live deer?

8
00:00:57,420 --> 00:00:58,820
I have been working as a guardian of the cemetery for more than ten years

9
00:00:58,940 --> 00:01:00,580
The same time I saw a red deer following people

10
00:01:01,540 --> 00:01:03,020
This guy met a pack of wolves in the mountains

11
00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:04,020
I saved him easily

12
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:05,900
Who would have thought that he would have to follow me?

13
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:08,200
I thought that with great strength I could break things apart

14
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:11,430
Just to avoid the difficulty and leave it really fresh

15
00:01:11,790 --> 00:01:13,390
I've only heard that some of the older generation raise deer.

16
00:01:14,130 --> 00:01:16,370
Ma Lu is famous for his stupid uncle Huang.

17
00:01:16,610 --> 00:01:17,970
Please put a ladder for me to go up.

18
00:01:18,170 --> 00:01:24,940
I'll give the factory a call and stay one more night. No problem.

19
00:01:25,460 --> 00:01:36,470
I happened to be alone and farted, so Uncle Huang

20
00:01:36,790 --> 00:01:38,870
I planted some willow roots in Shanxi and we will eat them tonight

21
00:01:39,190 --> 00:01:40,790
You said you still brought something?

22
00:01:41,190 --> 00:01:42,230
Okay, I'll take care of it

23
00:01:42,550 --> 00:01:44,430
Don't you want to contact the factory? Wu Qianian is right there.

24
00:01:48,070 --> 00:01:49,750
Factory Department Factory Department I am a horse trouble

25
00:01:49,990 --> 00:01:51,030
Please help inform my dad

26
00:01:51,150 --> 00:01:52,950
I'll stay in the mountains for two more days and everything will be fine.
